  "title": "Eggplant Croquettes",
  "description": "Cheese, bread crumbs, parsley, garlic and onion are mixed in with the cooked eggplant and formed into patties. A few minutes in hot oil and you have your croquettes.",
  "authors": [
    "Kelli Charnes"
  ],
